<title>USA: PhyMatrix buys physician management firm.</title>
<headline>PhyMatrix buys physician management firm.</headline>
<dateline>WEST PALM BEACH, Fla. 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>PhyMatrix Corp said Friday it has acquired a 51 percent interest in Brooklyn Medical Systems, a physicians' management company.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Brooklyn Medical Systems offers management services in all five boroughs of New York City.</p>
